{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V17advanceChangeTickAA0dE0VyF","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"advanceChangeTick","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChangeTick","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/World.swift#L211","fileName":"World.swift"},"title":"advanceChangeTick()","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@discardableResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"advanceChangeTick"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10ChangeTickV","text":"ChangeTick","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The new tick."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this method to mark a point in the world’s history. Afterward, a filter such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter\/changed(_:since:)-swift.type.method","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the earlier tick finds exactly"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the components changed since that point. The following example changes one entity’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"health after a checkpoint and then finds it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Health(current: 10))","let hero = world.spawn(Health(current: 10))","","let checkpoint = world.changeTick","world.advanceChangeTick()","world[Health.self, of: hero].current -= 1","","let changed = world.query(Health.self).changed(Health.self, since: checkpoint)","print(changed.map(\\.entity) == [hero])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A schedule calls this method before each system it runs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1), plus the cost of refreshing the world’s value indexes, if it has any."}]}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/advancechangetick()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts a new change tick, so components added or changed from now on are newer than every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"earlier tick."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/changeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lastRun","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackChanges(of:)"],"anchor":"Detecting-Changes","title":"Detecting Changes"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/advanceChangeTick()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/QueryFilter/changed(_:since:)-swift.type.method":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/queryfilter\/changed(_: